laude-code_2-1-212_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"aa9cb5ff-3fdb-44d3-8af8-c125c27f20ad","comments":[{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"REMEDIATION DONE. Stripped CLAUDE.local.md 155 -> 47 lines: kept ONLY machine/operator-local content (the origin/main-hourly LaunchAgent note + the Gerrit auth identities/credential-pinning guidance); added a short pointer header. Pre-strip backup at CLAUDE.local.md.bak (also in the job tmp).\n\nREMOVED-RULE -> NEW-HOME MAP (AC2: no guidance lost; every removed rule verified to have a home in AGENTS.md/docs, which land as part of this same epic):\n1. Fresh-worktree-from-origin/main discipline  -> AGENTS.md '## Git workflow' (Work in a fresh worktree branched from current origin/main...) + docs/local-dev-env.md (make worktree) + CONTRIBUTING.md.\n2. Activate-the-local-venv / repo-build check   -> docs/local-dev-env.md ('Verify you're on the repo build' + venv activation) + AGENTS.md env-bootstrap note (make install / make hooks).\n3. Plan-review signs on every round             -> docs/plan-review-gate.md + AGENTS.md 'Where to read' -> Gate protocols pointer.\n4. CI (Verified +1) before you close a ticket    -> AGENTS.md '## Git workflow' ('Do not close a ticket until its change is Verified +1 - a passing completion-verifier is not a substitute for green CI').\n5. 'Use rebar to track work' + the loop          -> AGENTS.md 'Record your work in rebar' + 'The parallel-agent workflow'; docs/user-guide.md; docs/ticket-model.md.\n6. Prefer MCP tools; concurrency is first-class  -> AGENTS.md 'Where to read' pointers (MCP -> docs/mcp-reference.md; concurrency -> docs/concurrency.md).\n7. 'Land through Gerrit, never commit to main'   -> AGENTS.md '## Git workflow - land changes THROUGH GERRIT' + CONTRIBUTING.md.\n\nAC3 MODERNIZATION DECISION: KEEP the CLAUDE.local.md filename; do NOT migrate to a gitignored @-import. Rationale: Claude Code still auto-loads CLAUDE.local.md; the new thin CLAUDE.md deliberately does NOT @-import it (keeping operator-local content out of the shared cross-vendor context) but points at it by name; migrating now is churn with no functional gain. Revisit only if Claude Code drops CLAUDE.local.md auto-loading.\n\nNOTE (git-ignored, no Gerrit change): this edit produces no committed artifact and no CI gate; the evidence above is the operator-attested proof for the AC2 'cite the location' criterion.","timestamp":1784254301472528001},{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"FORCE_CLOSE: close gate(s) bypassed by user approval — no completion/signature attestation was signed. Reason: \"CLAUDE.local.md is git-ignored so no commit can reference this ticket and the completion-verifier cannot read it; the strip is done and its evidence (removed-rule->new-home map, AC1 rg 'worktree|plan review|Track all work'==0, AC3 modernization decision, pre-strip backup) is recorded in the ticket comment. Non-codebase-verifiable operator-local edit -> force-close per the ADR 0043 soft path; leaves the epic certifiable:false as designed (epic ACs require closure+landing, not child signatures).\". Session: aa9cb5ff-3fdb-44d3-8af8-c125c27f20ad.","timestamp":1784254401920454001}],"created_at":1784230956988271001,"creation_channel":"unknown","deps":[{"link_uuid":"9ec01170-abe9-45e9-a083-3add5e1304f0","relation":"depends_on","target_id":"6642-814b-8bc5-4ff4"}],"description":"# Remediate CLAUDE.local.md to machine/operator-local content only\n\n## Why\n\n`CLAUDE.local.md` (155 lines) currently mixes two things: genuinely machine/operator-local\ncontent (this host's hourly `origin/main`-tracking LaunchAgent; the Gerrit credential\nidentities `RebarBotNava`/`JoeOakhartNava` and keychain specifics) and generally-applicable\nproject rules that are duplicated from `CLAUDE.md` (worktree discipline, activate-the-venv,\nplan-review signing, CI-before-close, the rebar tracking loop, a restatement of the Gerrit\nworkflow). The generally-applicable rules belong in the shared, checked-in guidance so every\nagent gets them; the local file should hold only what is specific to THIS machine/operator.\n\n## What\n\nStrip `CLAUDE.local.md` down to only machine/operator-local content, having first confirmed\n(via the AGENTS.md story) that every generally-applicable rule removed now lives in `AGENTS.md`\nor `docs/`. Keep: the local main-tracking LaunchAgent note and the Gerrit auth identities /\ncredential-pinning guidance. Optionally note that Anthropic now deprecates the `CLAUDE.local.md`\nname in favor of importing a gitignored file via `@` — record whether we adopt that or keep the\ncurrent name (a coherence decision, not required by this story).\n\n## Scope\n\nIn: `CLAUDE.local.md` only (git-ignored, local). Out: adding new content to `AGENTS.md`/`docs`\n(that is the AGENTS.md and re-home stories — this story only removes what they already re-homed).\nDepends on: the AGENTS.md story (the generally-applicable rules must have a home before removal).\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] `CLAUDE.local.md` contains only machine/operator-local content (main-tracking LaunchAgent\n  + Gerrit identities/credential pinning); no duplicated project-workflow guidance remains.\n  - Proving: reviewer confirms; `rg -c 'worktree|plan review|Track all work' CLAUDE.local.md`\n    trends to 0 for the generally-applicable rules.\n- [ ] Every rule removed has a verified home in `AGENTS.md` or `docs/` (no guidance lost).\n  - Proving: for each removed rule, cite the `AGENTS.md`/`docs` location in the change description.\n- [ ] Decision on the `CLAUDE.local.md`-name-vs-gitignored-`@import` modernization is recorded.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[{"path":"CLAUDE.local.md","reason":"strip to machine/operator-local only"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["depends_on","6642-814b-8bc5-4ff4"],["parent","81e2-ad5e-bfe2-4653"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"81e2-ad5e-bfe2-4653","parent_status_uuid":"e47b1afb-10cd-4cff-836c-77e9b574b81c","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"955c-7a98-2485-4209","ticket_type":"story","title":"Remediate CLAUDE.local.md to machine/operator-local content only","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["580a231c-dce5-4038-bf1f-0440fbf085b2","9ec01170-abe9-45e9-a083-3add5e1304f0","86208fac-0094-443a-a440-fcd15388b01b","65d1640e-6c2a-47dc-a6f2-a82f0e3cb222","1e5f4c3f-a9d6-4aff-9f5c-2a3fc5639fe1","321c0aec-0d57-43f1-bc8b-d5e0f505056a","608cbb42-877e-4804-8c45-71212cbe56bc","96e46211-1547-4dad-931b-ee19684edd7f","15348e02-65f9-45f1-839c-46e41a3bbe2e","e47b1afb-10cd-4cff-836c-77e9b574b81c","06a56702-e647-4e1d-891f-479578f8bd74","df211988-2742-42d7-a162-0312509ec6dd","aa83f64b-d9fb-4d15-a6a9-b2e08758c62f","f95ab049-5cd7-463b-9771-a9dac2633380","703da487-1208-4b2d-bb04-e8479e853fff","3a27c0d5-30ba-463f-a6c8-4e111fafd5d5","f841f5d1-8c72-453a-9bea-6358ea20cae6"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1785994099548593001,"uuid":"ea416b6e-34e7-45be-bcbb-a496b9d263bd"}